            <ArticleTitle>An unusual case of extraarticular lipoma of the knee joint.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>164-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Lipoma of the knee joint is a rare disease and most cases are lipoma arborescens within the joint. Here we report a case of true extraarticular lipoma of the knee.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
